tures-i18n.webp",[234,235,237],"h2",{"id":236},"currently-available-languages","Currently Available Languages",[239,240,241,245],"ul",{},[242,243,244],"li",{},"German",[242,246,247],{},"English",[223,249,250,251,256],{},"If you want to add another language, see the ",[252,253,255],"a",{"href":254},"#contributing","contributing section",".",[258,259],"hr",{},[234,261,263],{"id":262},"contributing","Contributing",[223,265,266,267,256],{},"We welcome contributions to improve or expand language support. To add a language or fix translations, create an issue in the FiveNet GitHub project or join directly through ",[252,268,272],{"href":269,"rel":270},"https:\u002F\u002Fpoeditor.com\u002Fjoin\u002Fproject\u002Fhszo85uo3K",[271],"nofollow","FiveNet's POEditor project",[274,275,277],"h3",{"id":276},"how-to-add-a-new-language","How to add a new language",[279,280,281,284,309,321,324],"ol",{},[242,282,283],{},"Create an issue in the FiveNet GitHub project to discuss the language you want to add.",[242,285,286,287],{},"Include the following details in the issue:\n",[239,288,289,297,303],{},[242,290,291,292,296],{},"Language name (for example ",[293,294,295],"code",{},"French",")",[242,298,299,300,296],{},"Language code (for example ",[293,301,302],{},"fr",[242,304,305,306,296],{},"Language icon (for example ",[293,307,308],{},"i-flagpack-fr",[242,310,311,312],{},"After approval, the language will be added to POEditor.\n",[239,313,314],{},[242,315,316,317,256],{},"Then create a POEditor account and join through ",[252,318,320],{"href":269,"rel":319},[271],"the project link",[242,322,323],{},"You can then start translating the strings in the POEditor project.",[242,325,326,327],{},"Developers sync translations from POEditor to FiveNet regularly.\n",[239,328,329,332],{},[242,330,331],{},"After sync and release, the language becomes available in the app.",[242,333,334],{},"If you run into issues, create a GitHub issue or ask in the FiveNet Discord server.",[258,336],{},[338,339,343,351],"card",{"target":340,"title":341,"to":342},"_blank","FiveNet uses POEditor for translations","https:\u002F\u002Fpoeditor.com\u002F",[223,344,345,346,350],{},"Thanks to ",[252,347,349],{"href":342,"rel":348},[271],"POEditor"," for providing FiveNet with a free translation project!",[223,352,353],{},[229,354],{"alt":355,"src":356,":width":357,":zoom":358,"align":359},"POEditor Logo","\u002Fimages\u002Fpoeditor-logo.svg","150","false","center",{"title":361,"searchDepth":362,"depth":362,"links":363},"",2,[364,365],{"id":236,"depth":362,"text":237},{"id":262,"depth":362,"text":263,"children":366},[367],{"id":276,"depth":368,"text":277},3,"md",null,{},true,{"title":155,"description":225},"gpzHWxUl9YWlcWNf1eEWMJyuvB9mdfMeKR4iqdcUJ30",[376,378],{"title":151,"path":152,"stem":153,"description":377,"children":-1},"Learn how to configure and manage settings in FiveNet, including job properties, roles, permissions, and app-wide configurations.",{"title":159,"path":160,"stem":161,"description":361,"children":-1},1789005924571]